  "question": {
    "text": "The correct order of the complexes $\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_5\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)\\right]^{3+}$ (A),<br />$\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_6\\right]^{3+}$ (B),<br/>$\\left[\\mathrm{Co}(\\mathrm{CN})_6\\right]^{3-}(\\mathrm{C})$ and $\\left[\\mathrm{CoCl}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_5\\right]^{2+}(\\mathrm{D})$ in terms wavelength of light absorbed is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "VWr9V",
      "text": "D&gt;A&gt;B&gt;C",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1Uwg5",
      "text": "C&gt;B&gt;D&gt;A",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "zoiol",
      "text": "D&gt;C&gt;B&gt;A",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GZ1PF",
      "text": "C&gt;B&gt;A&gt;D",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "We know $\\mathrm{E}=\\mathrm{h} v=\\frac{\\mathrm{hC}}{\\lambda}$<br />$\\mathrm{E} \\propto \\frac{1}{\\lambda}$<br />Here all Co in +3 oxidation state.<br />So, as the ligand field strength $\\uparrow, \\operatorname{CFSE} \\uparrow$<br />Order of field strength of ligand :<br />$\\mathrm{CN} \\gt \\mathrm{NH}_3 \\gt \\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O} \\gt \\mathrm{Cl}^{-}$<br />CFSE order : $\\mathrm{C} \\gt \\mathrm{B} \\gt \\mathrm{A} \\gt \\mathrm{D}$<br />Wavelength order: $\\mathrm{D} \\gt \\mathrm{A} \\gt \\mathrm{B} \\gt \\mathrm{C}$",
    "image": null
  },
